sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor user as User
  participant ui as Plugins panel
  participant pm as PluginManager
  participant reg as Registry URL
  participant zip as Release zip
  user->>ui: open Marketplace tab
  ui->>pm: fetch registry
  pm->>reg: GET plugins.json
  user->>ui: install entry
  pm->>zip: download downloadUrl
  Note over pm: sha256 must match before extract
  pm->>pm: extract in staging dir, load plugin
